{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The original crash is fixed for the bad-`t` cases I tried, and the late-answer tests now exercise actual consumption. I found two remaining gaps: four- and six-slot rows can still be confirmed and installed, and a loaded foreign-kind record can be confirmed despite the amended rule that leaves foreign records to their owner."}}
